<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY ENERGY OFF SAYS GAS WHOLESALE PRICE.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY ENERGY OFF SAYS GAS WHOLESALE PRICE.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's wholesale gas prices will increase by 13.5 percent as of July 1, the Energy Office said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;The gas prices have been increased at higher rate due to international purchase prices,&quot; said Imre Szabo, General Director of the Energy Office.</p>
<p>He added that the wholesale price increase was the one affecting oil and gas company MOL .</p>
<p>The end-user price will be 11.3 percent higher while domestic households prices will increase by 9.9 percent.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
